                <title><![CDATA[【DVD】DVD5 - Rolling Stones @ Hartford, CT 1999-03-29 (Audience DVD)]]></title>
                <link><![CDATA[https://sharemania.us/threads/rolling-stones-hartford-ct-1999-03-29-audience-dvd.296759/]]></link>
                <description><![CDATA[<article>
				<blockquote class="messageText SelectQuoteContainer ugc baseHtml">
					
					Rolling Stones @ Hartford, CT 1999-03-29 (DVD)<br>
<br>




<div class="bbCodeBlock bbCodeVfcHH HiddenContent">
	<div class="attribution type">Hidden Content:</div>
	<blockquote>You must either reply or click 'Like' to see the hidden information contained here.</blockquote>
</div>Surprised to not find this on YouTube so here ya go. Seems to be a 2 cam mix of cameras in similar places. I have a vague recollection of owning night 1 on VHS but I don't have it on DVD. <br>
<br>
2nd of 2 nights in Hartford on the No Security tour and first I Got The Blues since 1971. When The Whip Comes Down on B stage is tour highlight. Keith slides in front of Lisa on his knees before her Gimme Shelter spot. <br>
<br>
I know we already have the San Jose pro shot but this tour has plenty of standout shows and this is one of them.  Love this tour. Love this stage. <br>
